rong></p><p>This bill requires the Department of Health and Human Services to establish an online dashboard with information about federal grants relating to mental health and substance use disorders.&nbsp;</p><p>Among other requirements, the dashboard must be searchable, current, and indicate whether the application period is open or closed. The dashboard must also include information about associated state programs and subgrants.</p>","updateDate":"2026-10-27T20:06:25Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"ATTAIN Mental Health Act","type":"s","updateDate":"2026-10-27T20:06:50Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-10-27T20:06:50Z"}
